# Icon names made links to another of WhiteSur's pictures in the app icons:
# "<name> <WhiteSur's name>", at every size, in place of any picture WhiteSur
# has under that name itself.
#
# Names applications ask for that WhiteSur draws under another. An
# application that writes its own launcher at every start (Claude:
# X-Claude-Generated) cannot be pointed at WhiteSur's name.
claude-desktop claude
# Apple's pictures: the App Store's A for software centres (Discover's
# plasmadiscover links to it) and System Preferences' gear for settings
# (System Settings asks for preferences-system), as Flatpak's box and two
# toggles
softwarecenter flatpak-discover
preferences-system gnome-tweak-tool
preferences-desktop gnome-tweak-tool
